    "body": "<!--\n  Thank you for contributing to Neovim!\n  If this is your first time, check out https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#pull-requests-prs\n  for our PR guidelines.\n-->\n\n## Problem\nSwap/backup file names can become too long.\n\n## Solution\nUse `vim.fs.slug()` to generate shorter file names(`maxlen` is 64).\n\nrelated to #8137, #16159\n\nMaybe I can include the undofile in this PR as well, #7073",
